<title>USA: Digi Intl Inc Q2 March 31 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Digi Intl Inc Q2 March 31 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.70   profit	 $0.34</p>
<p> Net loss		   9,400   profit	 4,620</p>
<p> Revs			40,393		   47,973</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,382		   13,694</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 includes one-time restructuring charge of $10.5 million or $0.62/shr (net of income tax benefit). Results also include a loss of $1.6 million or $0.12/shr from an investment in AetherWorks Corp.  </p>
<p>		  6 MONTHS</p>
